{"id":379,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"言葉の力と探究で創造性を磨く女子教育","feature_description":"桐朋女子は「こころの健康 からだの健康」を掲げ、「ことばの力」を育てる教育を行っています。生徒の主体性を重視し、課題を見つけて解決する力や創造性を伸ばすことを目指します。授業では探究、フィールドワーク、実習、発表や討論などを取り入れ、調べたことを言葉で整理し、他者に伝える学びにつなげています。自ら考え行動する姿勢も育てます。","clubs":[{"id":6977,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6978,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6989,"name":"ESS","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6990,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6991,"name":"音楽部（音楽班）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6992,"name":"音楽部（合唱班）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6993,"name":"ギター部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6994,"name":"工芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6995,"name":"コンピュータ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6996,"name":"茶華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6997,"name":"自然科学部（化学班）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6998,"name":"自然科学部（生物班）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6999,"name":"自然科学部（天文班）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chuko.toho.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id